  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diak Rehab 10-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia CBR 10-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Huvudsyftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nniskor med funktionshiner   och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra deras tillg&#xe5;ng till och m&#xf6;jlighet att ut&#xf6;va sina        politiska, sociala, kulturella och ekonomiska r&#xe4;ttigheter. Fokus &#xe4;r   p&#xe5; rehabilitering p&#xe5; lokal niv&#xe5;. St&#xf6;det kanaliseras via Diakonia till 13 lokala organisationer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to empower people with disabilities and to        improve access and ability to exert their political, social, cultural and economic rights. The programme provides rehabilitation services   at the community level and link people with disabilities to available services at district and national levels. The support is chanelled    via Diakonia to 13 local NGOS.</narrative>
  </description>
